":"刚结婚不久的时候差点儿跟着镀金旅团离开，但想想总觉得不能抛下老婆出去漂泊。","nextNodeIds":[732050507]},{"nodeId":732050507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":3241765082,"text":"后来遇到行脚商，我又想跟着出去跑生意，最终因为本钱不够没走成。","nextNodeIds":[732050508]},{"nodeId":732050508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":715141210,"text":"再后来老太婆不在了，我没牵挂了，可是年纪已经太老，没法离开了。","nextNodeIds":[732050509]},{"nodeId":732050509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":2570292794,"text":"拖拖拉拉混到今天，我错过的事情太多。","nextNodeIds":[732050510]},{"nodeId":732050510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":376942554,"text":"回过头发现自己不属于这个村子，也不属于其他任何地方。","nextNodeIds":[732050511]},{"nodeId":732050511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":2070759114,"text":"最后结果么，就是我一个人搬到村子边上生活才舒服。","nextNodeIds":[732050512]},{"nodeId":732050512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":3796481810,"text":"几十年也就这么回事，算了。","nextNodeIds":[732050525]},{"nodeId":732050525,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":1068378634,"text":"这些花开了我就叫你们来看，明天或者后天，它们说不定就开了，你有空来看吧？","nextNodeIds":[732050526]},{"nodeId":732050526,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":2666097770,"text":"没问题。","nextNodeIds":[732050527]},{"nodeId":732050527,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":3853086850,"text":"好好好，我知道了…","nextNodeIds":[732050528]},{"nodeId":732050528,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":771209882,"text":"♪蔷薇啊蔷薇，实现我的愿望…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":732050513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":1789280658,"text":"关于鬼老头…","nextNodeIds":[732050514]},{"nodeId":732050514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":4287648026,"text":"也就只有外来的人会打听鬼老头的事了，我们村里的小孩可都知道这个名字。","nextNodeIds":[732050515]},{"nodeId":732050515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":2360751954,"text":"哪家孩子不听话，孩子的父母就吓唬他：马上鬼老头要来把你抓走了。","nextNodeIds":[732050516]},{"nodeId":732050516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":3919630698,"text":"这些年轻人啊，一个都不认识鬼老头，倒挺会把他的名头搬出来吓人。","nextNodeIds":[732050517]},{"nodeId":732050517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":832958402,"text":"我小的时候可是见过鬼老头本人的，他是讨厌小孩子没错，但长得也不恐怖。","nextNodeIds":[732050518]},{"nodeId":732050518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":683924554,"text":"不知道怎么就被传成了鬼老头，我看都是一帮闲人在背后胡说八道。","nextNodeIds":[732050519]},{"nodeId":732050519,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":2083456626,"text":"你们不是朋友吗？","nextNodeIds":[732050520]},{"nodeId":732050520,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":754735514,"text":"我还小的时候，经常溜到他的小花园附近玩，他一发现，就会挥着锄头把我赶走。","nextNodeIds":[732050521]},{"nodeId":732050521,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":3802528538,"text":"他八成只把我当成去捣乱的调皮小子，哪里会记得我哟。","nextNodeIds":[732050522]},{"nodeId":732050522,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":316169562,"text":"虽然他不一定认识我，但我还是一直记得他和他的小花园。","nextNodeIds":[732050523]},{"nodeId":732050523,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":1319398402,"text":"我说他是我的朋友，也不算错，不是吗？","nextNodeIds":[732050524]},{"nodeId":732050524,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","textMapHash":620888906,"text":"就当是为了还原我记忆里的小花园，我也会把这些花种出来的。","nextNodeIds":[732050525]}]}],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7320505,7320601,7320603,7320605],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"阿凡","count":40},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","coun